  "slug": "coconut-pancake-syrup",
  "name": "Coconut Pancake Syrup",
  "recipe_type": "dessert",
  "brief_description": "Try this recipe for coconut-flavored syrup next time you make waffles or pancakes.",
  "cuisine": "Hawaiian",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Whisk together the coconut milk and cornstarch in a saucepan until the cornstarch is dissolved. Pour in the corn syrup, sugar, and coconut; bring to a boil, stirring continually. As soon as the mixture comes to a rolling boil, remove from heat. Allow to cool completely before serving."
    }
